00:33:00.769 --> 00:33:02.769
Just try one more time.

00:33:02.769 --> 00:33:04.769
Please.

00:33:04.769 --> 00:33:14.019
My son, I've only had the joy of knowing you a few weeks.

00:33:14.019 --> 00:33:19.019
I wish I could be with you always to guide you and protect you.

00:33:19.019 --> 00:33:21.019
We don't have much time.

00:33:21.019 --> 00:33:26.019
My dearest Kallel, our love will always be with you.

00:33:26.019 --> 00:33:29.019
I can already see you carry within you your father's independent.

00:33:29.019 --> 00:33:31.019
father's independent spirit.

00:33:31.019 --> 00:33:35.019
But more importantly, your mother's never-ending bravery

00:33:35.019 --> 00:33:37.019
and her compassionate heart.

00:33:37.019 --> 00:33:42.359
Your father tells me the new world your journey into earth

00:33:42.359 --> 00:33:46.359
is full of complicated beings capable of great emotion.

00:33:46.359 --> 00:33:51.359
My wish is for you to live a full and wonderful life,

00:33:51.359 --> 00:33:56.359
but I need you to know you were born of a great love.

00:33:56.359 --> 00:33:59.359
And your brilliant father has devised a way for you to carry on that love.

00:33:59.359 --> 00:34:02.359
carry on that love without us.

00:34:02.359 --> 00:34:07.500
The ship I designed to carry you to your destiny

00:34:07.500 --> 00:34:10.500
can only hold one Kryptonian,

00:34:10.500 --> 00:34:13.500
one who has so much potential.

00:34:13.500 --> 00:34:15.500
So unlike your father,

00:34:15.500 --> 00:34:21.289
your mother and I cannot come with you.

00:34:21.289 --> 00:34:23.289
To do so would be to burden your innocent soul

00:34:23.289 --> 00:34:26.289
with our frailties and failures.

00:34:26.289 --> 00:34:30.289
But you have within you the best of both of us.

00:34:30.289 --> 00:34:33.289
And I'm sending with you all my knowledge.

00:34:33.289 --> 00:34:37.289
None of my ego or regrets.

00:34:37.289 --> 00:34:41.289
They will die with me here on crypt.

00:34:41.289 --> 00:34:46.980
Whatever trials I put you through,

00:34:46.980 --> 00:34:53.050
I will never lose faith in you.

00:34:53.050 --> 00:34:55.050
We may not have been able to save our planet.

00:34:55.050 --> 00:35:01.050
But we are confident you will become Earth's greatest savior.

00:35:01.050 --> 00:35:05.050
I never doubt that just as you are a part of us,

00:35:05.050 --> 00:35:08.050
we will always be a part of you.

00:35:08.050 --> 00:35:11.510
Farewell,

00:35:11.510 --> 00:35:47.139
My son. Hello, Granny.

00:35:47.139 --> 00:35:49.139
Desaad?

00:35:49.139 --> 00:35:55.050
Godfrey.

00:35:55.050 --> 00:36:01.280
He has been chosen.

00:36:01.280 --> 00:36:03.280
Dark Lord.

00:36:03.280 --> 00:36:07.280
Has anointed him, made him like us.

00:36:07.280 --> 00:36:08.280
A prophet.

00:36:08.280 --> 00:36:18.360
He is Darkside's third minion.

00:36:18.360 --> 00:36:20.360
So I do have a higher purpose.

00:36:20.360 --> 00:36:23.360
Yes, Godfrey.

00:36:23.360 --> 00:36:26.360
Your golden voice is broadcast around the world.

00:36:26.360 --> 00:36:27.360
Not impressed.

00:36:27.360 --> 00:36:28.360
Not impressed.

00:36:28.360 --> 00:36:31.360
And you, I see you're enjoying your clubs.

00:36:31.360 --> 00:36:34.360
They seem more popular than ever.

00:36:34.360 --> 00:36:37.360
Our unholy trinity is complete.

00:36:37.360 --> 00:36:39.360
I bind their bodies.

00:36:39.360 --> 00:36:41.360
Godfrey breaks their spirit.

00:36:41.360 --> 00:36:45.360
And you, my beloved friend,

00:36:45.360 --> 00:36:49.360
you clear their minds, preparing the way for Lord Darkseye.

00:36:49.360 --> 00:37:03.170
Yes and no.

00:37:03.170 --> 00:37:07.989
Yes, I think your mother is still watching over you.

00:37:07.989 --> 00:37:12.659
No. I don't think you're crazy.

00:37:12.659 --> 00:37:13.659
She didn't want me to do.

00:37:13.659 --> 00:37:16.659
to see her because she was afraid she would look weak.

00:37:16.659 --> 00:37:22.889
I think she felt like she had failed me by leaving.

00:37:22.889 --> 00:37:26.989
Clark, she's the brave...

00:37:26.989 --> 00:37:34.179
Maybe our parents thought that their mistakes would be

00:37:34.179 --> 00:37:37.179
some sort of burden on us.

00:37:37.179 --> 00:37:43.340
I would have liked to say goodbye.

00:37:43.340 --> 00:37:45.340
I think I could have handled it.

00:37:45.340 --> 00:37:47.340
Maybe they couldn't.

00:37:47.340 --> 00:37:50.340
I used to think Giraud was this strong and shakeable force,

00:37:50.340 --> 00:37:52.340
kind of like I thought I was supposed to be.

00:37:52.340 --> 00:37:57.219
I don't think he's the easiest guy to read being that he's a

00:37:57.219 --> 00:37:59.219
ice fortress at all.

00:37:59.219 --> 00:38:02.179
But there's part of him that's very human.

00:38:02.179 --> 00:38:10.099
of him that's very human.

00:38:10.099 --> 00:38:13.820
He blames himself for losing our home.

00:38:13.820 --> 00:38:15.820
All the weight I thought I had on my shoulders,

00:38:15.820 --> 00:38:17.820
he was carrying something so much heavier.

00:38:17.820 --> 00:38:22.159
And he didn't want you to carry it with him.

00:38:22.159 --> 00:38:25.570
I'm glad that you got to see him.

00:38:25.570 --> 00:38:27.570
Thank you for showing me that.

00:38:27.570 --> 00:38:29.570
Thank my mom.

00:38:29.570 --> 00:38:35.469
You can thank her for this, too.

00:38:35.469 --> 00:38:40.510
Toothbrush.

00:38:40.510 --> 00:38:42.510
My toothbrush.

00:38:42.510 --> 00:38:43.510
I'm in.

00:38:43.510 --> 00:38:47.079
Why don't you let me take you out?

00:38:47.079 --> 00:38:49.079
It's Powerball the night at the ace of clubs.

00:38:49.079 --> 00:38:51.079
Clark, Kent, and karaoke.

00:38:51.079 --> 00:38:53.079
Isn't that one of the signs of the apocalypse?

00:38:53.079 --> 00:38:56.079
I'll go get our coats.

00:38:56.079 --> 00:39:19.039
Are you blushing?

00:39:19.039 --> 00:39:23.289
No, I'm just happy.

00:39:23.289 --> 00:39:27.289
But if we don't get there soon, someone is going to steal all the white snake songs.

00:39:27.289 --> 00:39:44.780
It's going to start soon.

00:39:44.780 --> 00:39:49.400
Sooner than you think, Lois.

